<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus’ humanity,</l><l>With God enriched divine</l><l>Is constituting us</l><l>In spirit as we dine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus’ humanity,</l><l>Unique beyond compare,</l><l>Fulfills all righteousness;</l><l>To do God’s will, His fare.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus’ humanity</l><l>Takes on the lower place—</l><l>Lowly in heart, not grand</l><l>But humbled, serves in grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Jesus’ humanity</l><l>Bends in response to change,</l><l>Perfectly flexible</l><l>Our way to rearrange.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Jesus’ humanity</l><l>Does all things properly,</l><l>Setting things in array,</l><l>His living orderly.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Jesus’ humanity</l><l>Loves all those frail and weak;</l><l>He does not break the bruised</l><l>Nor quench them in critique.</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Jesus’ humanity</l><l>Cherishes sinful men,</l><l>Seeking to save the lost</l><l>And Jubilee begin.</l></lg>
<lg label="9."><l>Jesus’ humanity</l><l>Serves as a slave of God,</l><l>His service rendered by</l><l>Our ransom bought with blood.</l></lg>
<lg label="10."><l>Jesus’ humanity,</l><l>On earth, constrained by time,</l><l>Fulfills each prophecy,</l><l>Death’s hour endures, sublime.</l></lg>
<lg label="11."><l>Jesus’ humanity</l><l>Reconstitutes the saints,</l><l>Building the church, His house,</l><l>Wherein His rest awaits.</l></lg>
<lg label="12."><l>Jesus’ humanity</l><l>Cherish with holy praise!</l><l>Thus, in remembrance here,</l><l>One voice with reverence raise!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
